        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda fuga Israeli ea fuga Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damasis waseewa sugoocheanda Yuda Yehoshafati. Ak ghoah Yoram was orjeeda Ahabu sugoocheanda Israeli, ak goombal ng'eanyiida Samariya gweanyeew damaniyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak ea mawuurji ghwaan ea ghaamwat, aba gideaba niny gageanda daraneedida bea Baali ghayi sin ghwaaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji ghabwara geaw riing'eeda Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati, aba gideaba ghwanung' goodiiy fuga Israeli ak ea manung'waada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda Moabu siguura Mesha abeeda gooheagwiida gisilga. Ak inyeesa gilakweayda ghoadaw sugoocheanda Israeli buudeega gisilga sagalamnyooji bughala, ea gea lagweendiga sagalamnyooji bughala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghami Ahabu, hean ghaheawa sugoocheanda Moabu sugoocheanda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat aba geeshangiga Yoram aba Samariya ak gwayiida fuga Israeli sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeaksa sugoocheanda, sugoocheanda Yuda was Yehoshafati nea gwayeesha, “Niheawanaan sugoocheanda Moabu, heapi, gajamuusa eeteayeena eeng'ucheena sea Moabu?” Gwayeesha, “Gajeeteayeena aba gideaba aniini geawuurjeeweey nea fugeasu gawuurji fugaagu, eara faraasajeegeasu gawuurji faraasajeagaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanyaashta nea gwayeesha, “Gajealaabwa ana nawa?” Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Naweeda dareapcheeda Edomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa sugoocheanda Israeli nea goodeayi sugoocheanda Yuda, ea sugoocheanda Edomu. Gwaneay eawooji ispwa nea manda beega jea ghwali lugooda ghana gea jea ghwali haleanjeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda Israeli ak gwayi, “Eamuy deanya aba gideaba ninung' NG'UTAMIIDA gwaroonyi sugoodisu asamwaguun, ak ghwayiin saawa geatinga sugoocheanda Moabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yehoshafati ak gwayeesha, “Neada ea manda hiji sibaneeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geanyaashchi NG'UTAMIIDA aba naweadaanyi?” Hean ghwasha siyagi bea jeeda fuga gadiyeeda sugoocheanda Israeli nea gwayeesha, “Gwanda hiji Elisha was orjeeda Shafati, ghayi was siida weeda Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yehoshafati ak gwayi, “Siisi gwandeawa ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA.” Hean gaweesa Elisha sugoocheanda Israeli ea Yehoshafati ea sugoocheanda Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda Israeli, “Geendeayeesi naaha aniini ea ang'iing'i? Una heeda sibanga ghweanigaagu, ea sibanga geamadu.” Ghwalamda sugoocheanda Israeli ak gwayeesha, “Manda, masnu; aba gideaba niroonyi NG'UTAMIIDA sugoodi samwagu ak ghwayiin geatinga Moabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA lugweega ghamneawa aamiinaadawi madeadaanyi. Inyeeda gwachi ea meang'weersiini gheamamda Yehoshafati was sugoocheanda Yuda, gwachi maydeang'weerseey nea majeeroonyeena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ayeanean siida bara ginaanda.” Iidu nea ghwalas siidida ginaanda ghwanyas Elisha uurda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Agurgursiina shoomeanga jeedeaba moangoachiheen.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Mwajadaaha jeameeda ghana roopta, ak jeedeaba moangoachiheen gayghwanyiit beega ak gajaleaha, agooga ea dugweagwa ea haleanjeedeang'wa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheanji ea wusis aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gayghwayiin fuga Moabu geatingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajajoara mujiinajeega sean bea hilooga ea gilinyoo ea mujiinajeega miyaas, ea geediga miyaasiin sean gajalaja, nea gajadukuta gheanyanga eeniga sean bea mujiini, ak heeda miy sean gajanyarja aba lagheanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu sakteayda damanda siitaydaawa haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda was dearanga; hean geadaah ghapka beega nea gwaleabu naweeda Edomu, ea ghwanyiit ng'eanyiisean beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwanyas iita fuga Moabu gideaba gwascheeng'u sugoodisu asamwaguun gang'uchi saawa. Hean ghabwatgeat sean ea dabita nyaawa, was gilinyoo ghoamu ng'ucheeda, ghang'eada gheareemaneeda ea ghoah gweargwa ak gaweay ghamiinaada aba moonghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu sakteayda nea ghang'eat ng'eat fuga Moabu, geadaah ghameang'meang' aseeta aba badayda beega ak geadaah beegiga galu heanyaawaan ea areeri ea gawuurji foojeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyi, “Foojeanji nih gang'uchi sugoodiga nea ghabwatgeat, ak gabwa nih bwar nuut. Asi fuga Moabu sukwaanji easanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghapka museasooda fuga Israeli, hean ghang'eat fuga Israeli ak ghabwar fuga Moabu ea gwasalda aba madeanyaawa. Geeweay nea geabwaraada fuga Moabu ea ghwahita ng'eang'da nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geenyarjeaweada mujiinajeega ea gilinyoo ea shiidaneeda miy bea ng'eanyiida, gaba siisi jaksa lagheaneeda. Ak geedukuta gheanyanga eeniga sean, nea gealajaada geediga sean miyaasiin ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Gir-hareseti ak geanung'wa heeda lagheangaaschi. Nea fuga mideawa durumbeati geeneaweesa ak geabwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah sugoocheanda Moabu gideaba sijoar aba ng'ucheeda. Hean gageanu fih bughalaji ispwa sar ng'utkeaka nea abeeda gagasa gaweay heeda sugoocheanda Edomu ak ea mabadaksiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu orjeedaanyi was duweacheeda, gwachi jea gawa hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi. Ak ghoadayda ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda aba uhuuda ghamarda mujiini. Ak ghoah nyarasta muuchi aba heeda fuga Israeli, hean geenung'usa heeda niny ak gaweay gabiikta ng'eang'da nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
